{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22370","headline":"叹老三首 一 · 白居易","name":"叹老三首 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"晨兴照青镜，形影两寂莫。\n少年辞我去，白发随梳落。\n万化成於渐，渐衰看不觉。\n但恐镜中颜，今朝老於昨。\n人年少满百，不得长欢乐。\n谁会天地心，千龄与龟鹤。\n吾闻善医者，今古称扁鹊。\n万病皆可治，唯无治老药。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22370.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22370","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}